# UI/UX Agent Instructions

Read and follow `.agents/skills/premium-ui-ux/SKILL.md` whenever the
task involves frontend UI, UX, visual design, responsive design, landing
pages, dashboards, components, or motion.

Do not rewrite unrelated code. Inspect before editing. Implement the
requested surface, then verify the running result visually. Treat the
referenced galleries and libraries as inspiration/tools, not as
permission to combine multiple aesthetics.
